# Gruta del Eclipse (D1, contract 68: the hidden cave of the Piedra Eclipse), 20 x 16, a DARK cave (needs the Linterna to see it all: `@dark yes`; no wild creatures: a sanctuary). column = i, row = j. HARD TO FIND (contract 68.5):
# its mouth is on an islet of Ruta 21 (Surf to the landing, Cortador for the bush, the Medalla Brasa for the heat); inside, the Empuje boulder at (10,9) must be pushed north (3 pushes from (10,10)) into the pit (10,6) to open the corridor to the altar
# chamber. THE ALTAR (9,3): the stone (actor `estone`, the Piedra Eclipse, item 104) and the light shaft (actor `lshaft` at (8,2), falling from a crack in the roof) are SHOWN only at DAWN (05:00 .. 06:59) and around MIDNIGHT
# (23:00 .. 00:59) by the Flipper's clock (`clock cave`, read in the casino plugin; DEV / host: the clk_* flags); outside the windows the altar is empty. The on_enter script sets / clears the flag cave_open (the NPCs' show flag); the stone
# is taken once (has_item piedra_eclipse closes it for good). Look: the user's approved GRUTA scenes (tools/c10_mock.py): dark rock with light veins (`vrock`), the altar, stalagmites, the wall cubes of the Cueva Secreta (`swall`).
@map gruta_eclipse
@size 20 16
@interior no
@cave yes
@dark yes
@area gruta_eclipse
@bg 0
@fill vrock
@spawn door 10 12 N
@var gs 4
@legend
  .  tile=vrock
  W  tile=none object=swall
  r  tile=none object=srubble
  _  tile=none
  a  tile=vrock object=stalag_a
  c  tile=vrock object=stalag_b
  n  tile=vrock
  b  tile=vrock boulder=yes
  h  tile=vrock hole=gruta_pit
  A  tile=vrock object=altar interact=look script=altar npc=estone id=stone face=S solid=yes show_flag=cave_open
  L  tile=vrock npc=lshaft id=shaft face=S solid=yes text=gr.shaft show_flag=cave_open
@grid
  ____________________
  ___WWWWWWWWWWWWW____
  ___W....L.......r___
  ___W.a...A....a.r___
  ___W............r___
  ____rrrrrW.rrrrr____
  _________Whr________
  _________W.r________
  _________W.r________
  ___WWWWWWWbWWWWW____
  ___W............r___
  ___W..a.......c.r___
  ___W.c.......a..r___
  ___W............r___
  ____rrrrWnnrrrrr____
  _________rr_________
@warp n -> ruta_21 spawn=gruta_door
# The shaft's window: on entering, the stone and the shaft are shown only when the clock is at dawn (05:00 .. 06:59) or around midnight (23:00 .. 00:59) AND the stone has not been taken (key item, never lost).
@script cave_enter on_enter
    has_item piedra_eclipse gs
    jv gs 1 closed
    clock cave gs
    jv gs 0 closed
    setf cave_open
    end
  closed:
    clrf cave_open
@end
# The altar: with the stone shown (the window is open) the Piedra Eclipse is taken (the window is read again: it may have closed while the hero stood there); otherwise the altar is empty.
@script altar called
    jf cave_open try
    say gr.altar.empty
    end
  try:
    clock cave gs
    jv gs 1 take
    clrf cave_open
    say gr.altar.faded
    end
  take:
    say gr.altar.take
    give_item piedra_eclipse 1
    jv 0 0 full
    clrf cave_open
    sfx item
    say gr.altar.got
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
@end
